@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
hide footbox

title Undo inside the working model

box Model MODEL_COLOR_T1
participant "proposed:ModelManager" as Model MODEL_COLOR
participant ":VersionedTutorRoster" as History MODEL_COLOR
end box

[-> Model : undoAddressBook()
activate Model
Model -> History : undo()
activate History
History -> History : canUndo()
note right of History
Checks availability at runtime.
Asserts the working roster equals
the current committed state.
end note
History -> History : resetData(states.get(currentStatePointer - 1))
activate History
History --> History
deactivate History
note right of History
After restoration succeeds:
currentStatePointer--
end note
History --> Model
deactivate History
Model -> Model : updateFilteredPersonList(\nPREDICATE_SHOW_ALL_PERSONS)
activate Model
Model --> Model
deactivate Model
note right of Model
The live model is unchanged until
LogicManager saves and publishes
the working checkpoint.
end note
[<-- Model
deactivate Model
@enduml
